<title>ITALY: Italian theme park Gardaland to seek listing.</title>
<headline>Italian theme park Gardaland to seek listing.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders in Italian theme park operator Gardaland Spa approved a proposal to list the company on the Milan bourse, Gardaland said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The statement said the global coordinator of the flotation would be Morgan Stanley with Istituto Bancario San Paolo di Torino as lead manager.</p>
<p>Shareholders empowered the board to call an extraordinary assembly at a time of its chosing closer to the date of the planned flotation. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
